{"type":"message","message":{"role":"tool","parts":[{"type":"tool-result","callId":"call-4","output":"bash done\n\n## memory for bun run check:prose\n\n### [[Package Manager]]\n\nThe repo uses bun, never npm or pnpm. Install with `bun install`; the lockfile is bun.lock and CI installs with --frozen-lockfile.\n\n### [[Em Dash Ban]]\n\nNo em dashes anywhere in the tree: `bun run check:prose` fails on U+2014. Rewrite the sentence with a colon, a comma or a middle dot.\n\n### [[Test Gate]]\n\nThe gate is `bun run check && bun run test`. `bun run test` is vitest; bare `bun test` is Bun's own runner and is not the gate.\n\nA task is done only when both are green.\n\nretrieval: lexical","isError":false}]},"id":"233b3a1d-cf3d-4c57-9752-d958d3b1ffe0","parentId":"01ce80de-6e45-4db5-8b13-7a8ac8461977","timestamp":"2026-10-16T05:59:53.915Z"}
